{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_437e55d386afe831d23a86b47988825b88e06ab8f4d26fe6f15e1fb83131e0a7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41d99714751ee1ef31339da17d8434acf48fcb321f37105172d5971758976313","slc_a2bad4f554cfcfdece8c0b2b8170e0b040a3828f24646645222645cefa7de57b","slc_b7ecfbcf3f0435908ba9dc243fa60f3b13556145b1d44c94a805f9b4cfecae70","slc_d014a9cae15bf685bdc62c743fd1194b0a8b2eb26f0b470683ef95c4bc57097e"],"source_ids":["src_bbd45fcdbeee5d7e80256fff9e4915c2"],"text":"The memory retriever design prioritizes exhaustive exploration over efficiency, and keeps tools limited to data retrieval while the agent performs semantic analysis and response generation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_44911d8e39912ea551937173f3d00c630abb2092254c023a7f40da446ac470f0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_865cc6c8b95e7ca4cb7a85ebf95a654025fbfebb69001103187d06faa1de8e3b"],"source_ids":["src_84c23c9cbdcd559d93724bcf69c47939"],"text":"Training via reject_sampling.py runs a multi-round loop: an actor attempts the task, a verifier LLM decides continue/stop, a critic extracts experiences, and an updater writes accepted entries into the experience library JSON.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4efd055c34084012b33c8a01cb98b3fe87b9e67a8c9647c1f619979d0da4deda","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2dfad5ff98f0945453750d184875b39d5c56b0cebd8fc2c65611c93ee2f32058","slc_515248f2319046281e41b1571526cd46ab4bd90987841a0480f45e2b8d250358"],"source_ids":["src_84c23c9cbdcd559d93724bcf69c47939"],"text":"In FLEX evaluation, the experience library is wrapped via create_memory_retrieval_tool into a tool the Actor can call during reasoning when retrieval is enabled.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_525c59aa3d1930d4679511584bfc72bd6de27498e72aac9b48a5e97fac8767e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e5396c59604babb3805f40f4b29a1461c2df0c70899a5fe56f95f9b7b33be82","slc_b8a12cdbf82a48e4c705c8f10cfb338fe7a04941da0c6cf8f8257c18b512a6c0"],"source_ids":["src_bbd45fcdbeee5d7e80256fff9e4915c2"],"text":"Each memory entry stores a method description, rules with examples, a revised trajectory with comments, and metadata such as memory_type, problem_category, priority, and timestamps.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6033c9341e04ed26b98d86dd309d4f498e8001edd480496d2e883e08e871e3d8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04313331f6062e4a26ef820932a7e81e32e1b3f2f41470190d4edc27b3a11192","slc_39497fec10b1d876724cdefbf3161e7182773c0f6c3a33a955fc59d51cd4cd06"],"source_ids":["src_bbd45fcdbeee5d7e80256fff9e4915c2"],"text":"The retriever agent maintains per-partition exploration state (explored_up_to and recommended_indices) to avoid redundant exploration and support multi-turn continuity.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6e938a3cc0480141ce1c4634cc6d47c30a94b2cf7c9189cd00425a424d358f3b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_69f65bfbbd9570a11bafe5abbffbfb548effcc5511e5eae5e79066af64fa6286"],"source_ids":["src_84c23c9cbdcd559d93724bcf69c47939"],"text":"FLEX (Forward Learning from Experience) is a learning paradigm that shifts learning from modifying model parameters to building and leveraging an evolvable experience library.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","created_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_838ad953422c2926dc31fe65a39fd4f6a9ab9e85177d5a478f6ed8ab0e974c26","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"gensi-thuair/flex@b749fc351f81 snapshot c67fc1de393d9761","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_14ef326e7107c7e9b1aa015a4cb624fea92f5e1a61f978cf075758dd2b9bc52f","slc_1a56b5e3ba8a434af5b4323357e90d6cfd82eef15ac9c10071e77411fe036a45","slc_1e495ab5debcf5ed4553b9b5de0202f83276e0986ced6657a6b61bf8a67308c5","slc_8992b781e6ecb47709c0eb7247d9dd53e9cfa11d991837dac5a54898a891cdcd"],"source_ids":["src_bbd45fcdbeee5d7e80256fff9e4915c2"],"text":"The memory library is partitioned into Golden (successful experiences), Warning (failure cases), and Mixed (learning trajectories) partitions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:43:20Z","updated_by_operation":"op_eae86e1e9e504c909b2764e9c0665d12"}
